#27339
ancient note~
an ancient note~
A note scribbled in blood is here.~

I have failed my king
we tried and tried to make it to the
great hall or find any other survivors
but I was sent back to the surface to ask
the Gnomes for help. Alas all the gnomes
were dead, or appeared that way, when the city
was crumbling the dwarven citizens escaped
to the surface only to find even more death and
destruction. Before my very eyes it seemed the
bodies of the dead gnomes and dwarves were merging
into one and arising from the dead.
Bruland and I decided to leave messages along
the way in hopes of finding one another again.
I pray he has found you for all I have found is death.
Farewell to the lands I once knew.
~
