#27343
sealed letter~
a sealed letter~
A sealed letter has been dropped here.~

My Dearest Jalek
After entering the portal we found ourselves in a trap 
set for us by that foul Ronic. He was not with them or
I fear all would have been lost before it had begun.
During the middle of the battle the foulest beast that
I have ever seen attacked our armies, he ripped through
both Solamnic and unholy knight alike not carring for
one side or the other. After we slayed the foul beast
the Unholy knights were nowhere to be seen after some
time of wandering around lost in the strange fields we found
a hole leading into the caverns but also a path to some strange
village. Jalin lead some of the men in scouting the village
in hopes of finding some men that might be willing to help
our cause. 
I have sent word for him to come and help us finish off
the master of this foul chaos. I overcame Ronic soon after
entering the caves but even he had lost most of his men to
some other foul form of beast. 
My Jalek I fear this will be my final letter to thee, for even
if we are able to defeat the master of this chaos we may not
be strong enough to return. We have found his hiding hole and
while I see noone with him I hear him uttering some strange
word and then he is gone for awhile only to appear some time
later.
Please do not send anyone else into the portal, just seal off
the entrance and pray it is never opened again.
Your eternal lover, Arinasia.
~
