#27349
letter~
a letter~
A piece of parchment has been dropped here.~

Overlord Krass
 
We successfully entered the portal and layed in wait for the forces
that Jalek was sure to send. What a nice surprise to see that wench Arinasia
and that sniveling fool Jalin lead his forces. The trap was set and sprung
to certain success. Suddenly and with total surprise the solamnics were set
upon by the beutiful beasts that were in the lands. Seeing that the beasts
were no match for us but certainly more powerful than the solamnics I ordered
my men to retreat. Not wanting to waste our energy on them I let the beasts
dispose of the solamnics. 
I am at a massive golden door and am sending a few knights back with the news of
our imminent victory and dominence over whatever pitiful weaklings rule these lands.
I feel that we can put them to good use in our battle for control of the mainlands
and ultimate victory and conquest of Samsera.
 
Your faithful Cleric, 
Ronic
~
